+## Self-hosted on Wasmer
+
+[![Deploy to Wasmer](https://img.shields.io/badge/Deploy%20to-Wasmer-171717?logo=wasmer&logoColor=white)](https://wasmer.io/apps/create?github=dalibo%2Fpev2)
+
+Wasmer runs `npm install` and `npm run build`, then serves the generated
+`dist-app` folder (set in the `Staticfile`) as static files. The button opens
+Wasmer's import page for this public repository, where you review the
+configuration and click Deploy; it does not create a copy of the repository in
+your GitHub account.
+
